                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A sequel to top down survival shooter Nation Red that adds some Tower Defense elements and has a greater focus on co-op.\n\nExtremely basic, no explanations, here are some maps, build your fortifications (or not), enemy waves commence.\nAgain no campaign.\n\nI guess its for a very specific audience of that game that wanted something more, because if you step in it like I did, without forknowledge, you will feel lost and disappointed.\n\nHaving played Nation Red for a bit I can definitely say this isnt worth the investment.\n\n3/10",
